Flex Cover Card (formerly Enhanced Shutter Card)

This project builds on prior open-source work:

- hass-shutter-card by deejayfool — https://github.com/deejayfool/hass-shutter-card
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  Base roller-shutter concept and imagery.

- pic-shutter-card by samoswall — https://github.com/samoswall/pic-shutter-card
  Window, balcony-door, outside-view and curtain/blind images
  (files bundled here with the "psc-" prefix) are used with the
  author's permission.

Image files prefixed "psc-" in dist/ originate from pic-shutter-card and
were modified only by renaming. All other bundled images (prefixed "esc-")
are part of this project.
